  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. The filed repro still reproduces after INV-zikul (601fee315b) and INV-jahuf (17cd29d60f) changed c.py: main.c containing only int run(int fd){return (int)send(fd,\"x\",1,0);} emits c:external:0-0:send, and verify-claims gives NO-NET-SEND confirmed and SECRET-NO-NET confirmed, with no caveats and exit 0. Adding #include <sys/socket.h> gives c:sys/socket.h:0-0:send and NO-NET-SEND violated (exit 1). MECHANISM: c.py stamps an ambiguous libc name only from #include evidence; the external placeholder is skipped as the untyped-receiver residual."  # 5dc2
